ation and concurrency evidence.\",\"Phone change, explicit WeChat rebind, controlled account merge, and high-risk real-name recovery remain tracked Production V1 gaps and must not be removed from the handoff.\",\"VIS-001..004 remain local visualization evidence only. Day 4 release and Production V1 PASS remain unverified.\"],\"session_note\":\"READY for independent source, migration-draft, UI, and test-authoring work. This review changed nothing and ran no tests or external services.\"}\n",
