ENTITY-AI-001-review.json\"],\"unverified\":[\"Migration 0009 has not been created, applied, upgraded, downgraded, or regression-tested against any database. Disposable and persistent database migration require separate explicit approval.\",\"Real WeChat jscode2session, paid SMS delivery, real-name verification, Qwen LLM/VLM, ASR, bge-m3 embedding, reranker, and all other live-provider calls remain NOT_RUN pending credentials and authorization.\",\"ai_auto_assign remains False in persistent environments; enabling it there requires a separate operator decision after migration and concurrency evidence.\",\"Phone change, explicit WeChat rebind, controlled account merge, and high-risk real-name recovery remain tracked Production V1 gaps and must not be removed from the handoff.\",\"VIS-001..004 remain local visualization evidence only. Day 4 release and Production V1 PASS remain unverified.\"],\"session_note\":\"READY for independent source, migration-draft, UI, and test-authoring work. This review changed nothing and ran no tests or external services.\"}\ntokens used\n215,829\n",
